<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>👥 MEENGLE - COMMUNITY GUIDELINES</h1>
    <p><strong>Last Updated: January 2024</strong></p>

    <p>MEENGLE is a community platform dedicated to helping people find meaningful connections. These Community Guidelines ensure MEENGLE remains a safe, respectful, and welcoming place for everyone.</p>

    <div class="warning">
      <strong>⚠️ Remember:</strong> Violations of these guidelines may result in warnings, temporary suspension, or permanent banning from MEENGLE.
    </div>

    <h2>✅ BE RESPECTFUL & AUTHENTIC</h2>
    
    <div class="rule do">
      <strong>✓ DO:</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Be genuine and honest in your profile</li>
        <li>Use recent, clear photos of yourself</li>
        <li>Treat all users with kindness and respect</li>
        <li>Accept rejection gracefully</li>
        <li>Engage in meaningful conversations</li>
        <li>Report problematic users</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="rule dont">
      <strong>✗ DON'T:</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Use fake or misleading photos</li>
        <li>Catfish or impersonate others</li>
        <li>Be rude, insulting, or dismissive</li>
        <li>Harass users who aren't interested</li>
        <li>Pressure someone into conversation</li>
        <li>Continue messaging after someone asks you to stop</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>🔒 SAFETY FIRST</h2>
    
    <div class="rule do">
      <strong>✓ DO:</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Verify people's identities before meeting</li>
        <li>Meet in public places</li>
        <li>Tell trusted friends where you're going</li>
        <li>Trust your instincts</li>
        <li>Take time to get to know someone</li>
        <li>Report unsafe behavior immediately</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="rule dont">
      <strong>✗ DON'T:</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Share personal details too quickly (address, workplace, phone)</li>
        <li>Send money to someone you haven't met</li>
        <li>Meet alone in private locations initially</li>
        <li>Ignore red flags or concerning behavior</li>
        <li>Feel pressured to move conversations off the app</li>
        <li>Share explicit content you didn't consent to</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>💬 APPROPRIATE CONTENT</h2>
    
    <div class="rule do">
      <strong>✓ DO:</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Share interesting conversation starters</li>
        <li>Post appropriate photos (face, full body, lifestyle)</li>
        <li>Discuss your interests, goals, and values</li>
        <li>Be clear about what you're looking for</li>
        <li>Keep conversations pleasant and respectful</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="rule dont">
      <strong>✗ DON'T:</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Post sexually explicit photos or content</li>
        <li>Share nude or intimate images</li>
        <li>Send unsolicited explicit messages</li>
        <li>Use offensive language or slurs</li>
        <li>Make racist, sexist, homophobic, or discriminatory comments</li>
        <li>Share graphic violence or illegal content</li>
        <li>Post screenshots of conversations without consent</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>🚫 PROHIBITED BEHAVIOR</h2>
    
    <h3>Harassment & Abuse</h3>
    <p>MEENGLE has zero tolerance for harassment, bullying, or abuse.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Repeated unwanted messages = harassment</li>
      <li>Threats, insults, or degrading language</li>
      <li>Threatening violence or harm</li>
      <li>Doxxing (sharing someone's personal information)</li>
      <li>Coordinated attacks by multiple users</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Discrimination & Hate Speech</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Racist, sexist, religious, or ethnic slurs</li>
      <li>Discriminating based on race, gender, religion, sexual orientation, disability</li>
      <li>Hate speech or extremist content</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Fraud & Scams</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Catfishing or using fake identities</li>
      <li>Romance scams or asking for money</li>
      <li>Fake investment opportunities</li>
      <li>Cryptocurrency or MLM schemes</li>
      <li>Phishing or malicious links</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Commercial Activity</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Promoting businesses or services</li>
      <li>Advertising products or affiliate links</li>
      <li>Selling subscriptions, courses, or goods</li>
      <li>Spam or mass messaging</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Illegal Activity</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Promoting illegal substances or weapons</li>
      <li>Soliciting illegal services</li>
      <li>Child exploitation or abuse</li>
      <li>Human trafficking or modern slavery</li>
      <li>Any other criminal activity</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>📸 PHOTO GUIDELINES</h2>
    
    <div class="rule do">
      <strong>✓ ACCEPTABLE PHOTOS:</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Clear, recent photos of your face</li>
        <li>Full-body shots showing who you are</li>
        <li>Lifestyle photos (hobbies, travel, activities)</li>
        <li>Group photos (clearly marked as not you)</li>
        <li>Photos without heavy filters</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="rule dont">
      <strong>✗ NOT ALLOWED:</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Explicit or nude photos</li>
        <li>Photos of other people without permission</li>
        <li>Graphic or violent content</li>
        <li>Photos of animals presented as yourself</li>
        <li>Excessively filtered or misleading photos</li>
        <li>Copyrighted celebrity photos</li>
        <li>Screenshots of other people's profiles</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>🚩 REPORT & BLOCK</h2>
    
    <p>If you encounter someone violating these guidelines:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Block:</strong> Click the block button to prevent them from messaging</li>
      <li><strong>Report:</strong> Use the report feature to alert our moderation team</li>
      <li><strong>Details:</strong> Provide specific examples of the violation</li>
      <li><strong>Screenshot:</strong> Include screenshots of problematic messages</li>
      <li><strong>Don't Engage:</strong> Do not respond to or engage with violations</li>
    </ul>

    <p><strong>Our moderation team reviews all reports within 24 hours.</strong> We take every report seriously.</p>

    <h2>⚖️ ENFORCEMENT & CONSEQUENCES</h2>
    
    <p>Violations of these guidelines result in:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>First Offense:</strong> Warning or temporary suspension (24 hours - 7 days)</li>
      <li><strong>Second Offense:</strong> Extended suspension (7 days - 30 days)</li>
      <li><strong>Third Offense:</strong> Permanent ban from MEENGLE</li>
      <li><strong>Severe Violations:</strong> Immediate permanent ban (harassment, illegal activity, hate speech)</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Banned users cannot create new accounts or use MEENGLE services.</p>

    <h2>💡 TIPS FOR A GREAT EXPERIENCE</h2>
    
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Be Yourself:</strong> Authenticity is attractive. Don't pretend to be someone you're not.</li>
      <li><strong>Respect Boundaries:</strong> If someone isn't interested, accept it gracefully.</li>
      <li><strong>Stay Safe:</strong> Never rush to meet or share personal information.</li>
      <li><strong>Communicate Clearly:</strong> Be upfront about what you're looking for.</li>
      <li><strong>Use Descriptive Bios:</strong> Help potential matches understand who you are.</li>
      <li><strong>Respond Thoughtfully:</strong> Personalized messages work better than generic openers.</li>
      <li><strong>Report Issues:</strong> Help us keep MEENGLE safe by reporting violations.</li>
      <li><strong>Take Breaks:</strong> Dating apps can be draining. Take time for yourself.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>❓ QUESTIONS?</h2>
    
    <p>If you have questions about these guidelines or need to report a violation:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Email:</strong> support@meengle.com</li>
      <li><strong>In-App Report:</strong> Use the report feature on any profile or message</li>
      <li><strong>Safety Team:</strong> safety@meengle.com (for safety concerns)</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="warning">
      <strong>Remember:</strong> MEENGLE is a community. We all play a role in keeping it safe, respectful, and fun. Thank you for being a responsible member of the MEENGLE community! 💚
    </div>

